[LEONARDO]
You MUST be able to think of a way to stop something like that!
ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງຄິດວິທີທີ່ຈະຢຸດສິ່ງນັ້ນໄດ້!

877
00:53:19,450 --> 00:53:25,450
